<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">At the maximum of the offering range, Columbia Financial, Inc. will sell 192,625,000 shares. </p></td></tr></table>
