<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Represents 4,542,855 shares purchased in Columbia Financial&#8217;s 2018 minority stock offering, as adjusted for the 2.5340 exchange ratio at the maximum of the offering range. </p></td></tr></table>
