</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The following table shows the total number of shares of Columbia Financial, Inc. common stock that will be outstanding after the completion of the offering, the exchange of shares of Columbia Financial for shares of Columbia Financial, Inc. and the completion of the Merger, assuming that 100% of Northfield Bancorp&#8217;s outstanding shares of common stock are exchanged for shares of Columbia Financial, Inc. common stock in the Merger. Information is presented at the adjusted minimum, minimum, midpoint and maximum of the offering range. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
