 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The following table presents a summary of selected pricing ratios for the peer group companies utilized by RP Financial in its appraisal and the pro&#160;forma pricing ratios for us as calculated by RP Financial in its appraisal report, based on financial data as of and for the twelve&#160;months ended December&#160;31, 2025. Stock prices are as of February&#160;2, 2026 as reflected in the appraisal report. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
