<td style="width:1%;vertical-align:top">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left">that the Merger and any related transactions (including, without limitation, the Bank Merger, the Conversion and related Columbia Financial, Inc. common stock offerings) would be completed substantially in accordance with the terms set forth in the Merger Agreement (the final terms of which KBW assumed would not differ in any respect material to its analyses from the execution version reviewed by KBW and referred to above), with no adjustments to the aggregate merger consideration (including the stock or cash components thereof) and with no other consideration or payments in respect of Northfield Bancorp common stock; </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
