<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">The year ended December&#160;31, 2025, included a $41.0&#160;million <span style="white-space:nowrap">non-cash,</span> <span style="white-space:nowrap">non-tax</span> deductible goodwill impairment charge and $580,000 additional tax expense related to options that expired in May 2025. </p></td></tr></table>
