<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">The year ended December&#160;31, 2024, included a $2.4&#160;million, after tax, gain on the sale of property, $795,000 additional tax expense related to options that expired in June 2024, and $492,000, after tax, of severance costs. </p></td></tr></table>
