<div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto">
 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center" id="toc92655_23">HOW COLUMBIA FINANCIAL, INC. INTENDS TO USE THE PROCEEDS FROM THE OFFERING </p> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Although we cannot determine what the actual net proceeds from the sale of the shares of common stock in the offering will be until the offering is completed, we anticipate that the net proceeds will be between $966.0&#160;million and $1.9&#160;billion. See the section of this Joint Proxy Statement/Prospectus entitled &#8220;<span style="font-style:italic">Pro Forma Data&#8221;</span> for the assumptions used to arrive at these amounts. </p> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We intend to distribute the net proceeds as follows: </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
