<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Impact of terminating the Northfield Bancorp ESOP at closing assuming an acquisition price of $14.25 in cash and stock merger consideration. </p></td></tr></table>
<table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:9pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
