<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Total multifamily and commercial real estate loans</p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:bottom">$</td>
<td style="white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right">4,190,873</td>
