<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Total securities available for sale</p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
