<div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto">
 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="font-weight:bold"><span style="font-style:italic">Loan Portfolio Maturities.</span></span> The following tables summarize the scheduled repayments of Northfield Bank&#8217;s loan portfolio and weighted average contractual rate by loan type at December&#160;31, 2025.&#160;Demand loans (loans having no stated repayment schedule or maturity) and overdraft loans are reported as being due in the year ending December&#160;31, 2026. Maturities are based on the final contractual payment date and do not reflect the effect of prepayments, repricing and scheduled principal amortization. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
