<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Includes <span style="white-space:nowrap">non-accruing</span> loans. Interest income on loans includes amortization of deferred loan fees, net of deferred loan fees, which was not material. </p></td></tr></table>
