<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Securities <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span style="white-space:nowrap">available-for-sale</span></span> are reported at amortized cost. </p></td></tr></table>
