 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">These <span style="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</span> financial measures should not be viewed as a substitute for financial results in accordance with GAAP, nor are they necessarily comparable to <span style="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</span> performance measures with similar names that may be presented by other companies. The following tables present reconciliations of these <span style="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</span> measures to the applicable amounts measured in accordance with GAAP. </p> <p style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold"><span style="font-style:italic">Core Net Income at Bank Level </span></p> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
