<td>&#160;</td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Company had <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LoansReceivableHeldForSaleAmount" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="ixv-167097"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LoansReceivableHeldForSaleAmount" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="ixv-167098">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> loans <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;"><div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">held-for-sale</div></div> at December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024. During the year ended December&#160;31, 2025, the Company sold $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_SingleFamilyRealEstateLoanMemberusgaapFinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167099">16.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_CommercialPortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167100">10.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_ConstructionLoansMemberusgaapFinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167101">8.6</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million of <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;"><div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">one-to-four</div></div> family real estate loans, construction loans, and SBA loans included in commercial business loans <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">held-for</div> sale, respectively, resulting in gross gains of $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:GainOnSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167102">899,000</ix:nonFraction> and gross losses of $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:LossOnSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167103">100,000</ix:nonFraction>. During the year ended December&#160;31, 2024, the Company sold $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_SingleFamilyRealEstateLoanMemberusgaapFinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167104">8.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_CommercialRealEstateMemberusgaapFinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167105">3.3</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_ConstructionLoansMemberusgaapFinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167106">6.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million of <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;"><div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">one-to-four</div></div> family real estate loans, construction loans, and SBA loans included in commercial business loans <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">held-for</div> sale, respectively, resulting in gross gains of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_CommercialPortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167107">906,000</ix:nonFraction> and no gross losses. During the year ended December&#160;31, 2023, the Company sold $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_SingleFamilyRealEstateLoanMemberusgaapFinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167108">73.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_ConstructionLoansMemberusgaapFinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167109">21.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_CommercialPortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167110">8.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, and $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:GainOnSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167111">18.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million of <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;"><div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">one-to-four</div></div> family real estate loans and home equity loans, commercial real estate loans, construction loans, and SBA loans included in commercial business loans <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;"><div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">held-for-sale,</div></div> respectively, resulting in gross gains of $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:LossOnSaleOfLoansHeldForSale" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167112">2.3</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and gross losses of $1.0&#160;million. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">During the year ended December&#160;31, 2025, the Company purchased $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireLoansReceivable" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_CommercialRealEstateMemberusgaapFinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167113">130.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million in equipment finance loans, included in commercial business loans, and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireLoansReceivable" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_CommercialRealEstateMemberusgaapFinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167114">20.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million in construction loan participations from a third-party. During the year ended December&#160;31, 2024, the Company purchased $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireLoansReceivable" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMemberusgaapFinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_SingleFamilyRealEstateLoanMemberusgaapFinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167115">78.7</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million of commercial real estate and participation loans from a third party financial institution. During the year ended December&#160;31, 2023, the Company purchased a $14.7&#160;million commercial real estate participation loan from a third party. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Company has entered into guarantor swaps with Freddie Mac which results in improved liquidity. During the year ended December&#160;31, 2025, the Company exchanged $13.3&#160;million of loans for Freddie Mac mortgage participation certificates, resulting in gross gains of $129,000, and no gross losses. During the years ended December&#160;31, 2024 and 2023, no loans were exchanged for Freddie Mac mortgage participation certificates. The Company retained the servicing of these loans. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">At December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, the carrying value of loans serviced by the Company for investors was $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ServicingLiabilityAtAmortizedValueBalance" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167116">494.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ServicingLiabilityAtAmortizedValueBalance" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167117">503.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively. These loans are not included in the Consolidated Statements of Financial Condition. Servicing income totaled $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FeesAndCommissionsMortgageBankingAndServicing" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167118">1.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for each of the years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Company has granted loans to certain officers and directors of the Company and its subsidiaries and to their associates. At December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, such loans totaled approximately $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestBeforeAllowanceForCreditLoss" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_AffiliatedEntityMemberusgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167119">2.2</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestBeforeAllowanceForCreditLoss" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_AffiliatedEntityMemberusgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167120">2.6</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively. During the years ended December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, <ix:nonFraction name="clbk:FinancingReceivableNumberOfLoansGrantedToRelatedParty" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AffiliatedEntityMemberusgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis" unitRef="Unit_loan" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:fixed-zero" id="ixv-167121">no</ix:nonFraction> new loans were granted to related parties. During the year ended December&#160;31, 2023, <ix:nonFraction name="clbk:FinancingReceivableNumberOfLoansGrantedToRelatedParty" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_AffiliatedEntityMemberusgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis" unitRef="Unit_loan" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="ixv-167122">one</ix:nonFraction> new loan was granted to a related party totaling $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireLoansReceivable" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_AffiliatedEntityMemberusgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-167123">100,000</ix:nonFraction>. These loans are performing in accordance with their original terms. </div><div style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center"><ix:exclude>F-26</ix:exclude> </div></ix:nonNumeric></div></div></div><ix:continuation id="TextSelection_156156388" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156156388_1"><div></div></ix:continuation></div><div><div style="line-height:normal;display: inline;"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156156388_1" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156156388_2"><ix:exclude><div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156156388_2" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156156388_3"><ix:exclude><hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156156388_3" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156156388_4"><ix:exclude><div style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold; margin-top: 1.67em; margin-bottom: 1.67em;"><a href="#toc">Table of Contents</a></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156156388_4" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156156388_5"><ix:exclude><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align: