on>&#160;million as of December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. </div><ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:TimeDepositMaturitiesTableTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-93536"><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Scheduled maturities of certificates of deposit accounts at December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024 are summarized as follows: </div><div style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
