<td>&#160;</td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">SERP Plans </div></div><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Columbia Bank has a SERP, which is a <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">non-qualified</div> plan which provides supplemental retirement benefits to eligible officers (those designated by the Board of Directors) of the Company who are prevented from receiving the full benefits contemplated by the ESOP&#8217;s benefit formulas under tax law limits for <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">tax-qualified</div> plans. SERP compensation (benefit) expense for the years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024, and 2023, was $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherPostretirementBenefitExpense" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169201">40,000</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherPostretirementBenefitExpense" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169202">46,000</ix:nonFraction>, and $(<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherPostretirementBenefitExpense" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" sign="-" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169203">32,000</ix:nonFraction>), respectively. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Company also has a Supplemental Executive Retirement Plan for certain executives as designated by the Board of Directors to provide <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">non-qualified</div> retirement benefits to participants. For the years ended December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, the Company recorded an expense of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherPostretirementBenefitExpense" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_DirectorMemberusgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169204">194,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherPostretirementBenefitExpense" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_DirectorMemberusgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169205">96,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, in connection with this Plan. There was <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherPostretirementBenefitExpense" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_DirectorMemberusgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:fixed-zero" id="ixv-169206">no</ix:nonFraction> expense recorded in connection with this plan for the year ended December&#160;31, 2023. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Through the acquisition of Roselle Bank, the Company acquired a <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">non-contributory</div> defined benefit supplemental executive retirement plan with the only participant being the former president of Roselle Bank. For the years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024, and 2023, the Company recorded a net periodic benefit cost of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanNetPeriodicBenefitCost" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredRosellePlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169207">18,000</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanNetPeriodicBenefitCost" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_AcquiredRosellePlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169208">19,000</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanNetPeriodicBenefitCost" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_AcquiredRosellePlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169209">20,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, in connection with this plan. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Through the acquisition of Freehold Bank, the Company acquired a <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">non-contributory</div> defined benefit supplemental executive plan with the only participant being the former president of Freehold Bank. For the years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024, and 2023 the Company recorded a net periodic benefit cost of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanNetPeriodicBenefitCost" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredFreeholdPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169210">14,000</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanNetPeriodicBenefitCost" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_AcquiredFreeholdPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169211">4,000</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanNetPeriodicBenefitCost" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_AcquiredFreeholdPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_SupplementalEmployeeRetirementPlanDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169212">2,000</ix:nonFraction> respectively, in </div><div style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center"><ix:exclude>F-53</ix:exclude> </div></ix:continuation></div></div><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_40" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_41"><ix:exclude><div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_41" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_42"><ix:exclude><hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_42" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_43"><ix:exclude><div style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold; margin-top: 1.67em; margin-bottom: 1.67em;"><a href="#toc">Table of Contents</a></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation></div></div> <div><div style="line-height:normal;display: inline;"><div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_43" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_44"><ix:exclude><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">COLUMBIA FINANCIAL, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES </div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements </div><div style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%">
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid">
<td style="width:4%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;">(14)</div></td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:left">Employee Benefit Plans&#8201;(continued) </div></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">SERP Plans&#8201;(continued) </div></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_44" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_45"><div style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">connection with this plan. At December&#160;31, 2025, this plan was merged into the Roselle Bank supplemental executive retirement plan for financial reporting purposes. </div><div style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">Director Retirement Income Plan </div></div><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Through the acquisition of Freehold Bank, the Company acquired a Director Retirement Income Plan, which provides former retired directors a benefit equal to $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:DefinedBenefitPlanAnnualBenefitPaymentAmount" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredFreeholdPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169214">12,000</ix:nonFraction> per annum, payable in equal installments over <ix:nonNumeric name="clbk:DefinedBenefitPlanBenefitPaymentInstallmentPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredFreeholdPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" id="ixv-169215">120</ix:nonNumeric> months when the director reaches emeritus age, as defined by the plan. At December&#160;31, 2024, the Company had an accrued liability of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PensionAndOtherPostretirementDefinedBenefitPlansLiabilitiesCurrentAndNoncurrent" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_AcquiredFreeholdPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169216">354,000</ix:nonFraction> related to this plan. For the years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024, and 2023 the net periodic benefit cost (income) recorded in connection with this plan was $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanNetPeriodicBenefitCost" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredFreeholdPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169217">15,000</ix:nonFraction>, $(<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanNetPeriodicBenefitCost" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_AcquiredFreeholdPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" sign="-" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169218">1,000</ix:nonFraction>) and $(<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanNetPeriodicBenefitCost" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_AcquiredFreeholdPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" sign="-" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169219">24,000</ix:nonFraction>), respectively. At December&#160;31, 2025, the Company had <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PensionAndOtherPostretirementDefinedBenefitPlansLiabilitiesCurrentAndNoncurrent" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_AcquiredFreeholdPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="ixv-169220">no</ix:nonFraction> accrued liability related to this plan as it was merged into the Roselle Bank supplemental executive retirement plan for financial statement purposes. </div><div style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">Executive Incentive Retirement Plan </div></div><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Through the acquisition of RSI Bank, the Company acquired an executive incentive retirement plan. At December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, the Company had an accrued liability of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PensionAndOtherPostretirementDefinedBenefitPlansLiabilitiesCurrentAndNoncurrent" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169221">269,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PensionAndOtherPostretirementDefinedBenefitPlansLiabilitiesCurrentAndNoncurrent" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169222">255,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, related to this plan. For the years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024, and 2023, the expense recorded in connection with this plan was $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanAdministrationExpenses" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169223">20,000</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanAdministrationExpenses" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169224">2,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanAdministrationExpenses" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_OtherPensionPlansPostretirementOrSupplementalPlansDefinedBenefitMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169225">11,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. </div><div style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">Board of Directors and Executive Deferred Compensation Plan and Key Life Insurance Plan </div></div><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Through the acquisition of RSI Bank, the Company acquired a deferred compensation plan for the former Board of Directors and executives. Under the terms of the plan, for directors who elected not to receive directors&#8217; fees for a period of <ix:nonNumeric name="clbk:DefinedBenefitPlanPeriodDirectorsElectedNotToReceiveDirectorFees" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_PostemploymentRetirementBenefitsMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="ixv-169226">five years</ix:nonNumeric>, their fees were used to purchase key insurance on the life of each director in the amount calculated to meet the Company&#8217;s obligations under the plan. Benefits payable under the plan, which accrue in accordance with a ten year schedule, consist of monthly payments commencing at age <ix:nonFraction name="clbk:DefinedBenefitPlanPaymentCommencementAge" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_PostemploymentRetirementBenefitsMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_age" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169227">65</ix:nonFraction> or <ix:nonNumeric name="clbk:DefinedBenefitPlanPeriodDirectorsElectedNotToReceiveDirectorFees" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_PostemploymentRetirementBenefitsMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="ixv-169228">five years</ix:nonNumeric> from the date the plan was implemented for those participants who already reached age <ix:nonFraction name="clbk:DefinedBenefitPlanPaymentCommencementAge" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_PostemploymentRetirementBenefitsMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_age" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169229">65</ix:nonFraction>. At December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, the Company had an accrued liability of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PensionAndOtherPostretirementDefinedBenefitPlansLiabilitiesCurrentAndNoncurrent" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_PostemploymentRetirementBenefitsMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169230">161,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PensionAndOtherPostretirementDefinedBenefitPlansLiabilitiesCurrentAndNoncurrent" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_PostemploymentRetirementBenefitsMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169231">227,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, related to this plan. For the years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, the expense recorded in connection with this plan was $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanAdministrationExpenses" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_PostemploymentRetirementBenefitsMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169232">7,000</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanAdministrationExpenses" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_PostemploymentRetirementBenefitsMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169233">9,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanAdministrationExpenses" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_AcquiredRSIPlanMemberusgaapRetirementPlanNameAxis_PostemploymentRetirementBenefitsMemberusgaapRetirementPlanTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169234">11,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. </div><div style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">Stock Based Deferral Plan and Directors Deferred Compensation Plan </div></div><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">In addition, Columbia Bank maintains a stock based deferral plan for certain executives and directors, and a cash based deferred compensation plan for directors. The Company records a deferred compensation equity account and corresponding contra-equity account for the cost of the shares held by the Stock Based Deferral Plan. Periodic adjustments to market are not required as participants do not have the option to take the distribution in cash. The Company records a liability for the amount deferred under the Directors Deferred Compensation Plan. There were no expenses recorded under these plans. </div><div style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">Stock Based Compensation </div></div><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">At the Company&#8217;s annual meeting of stockholders held on June&#160;6, 2019, stockholders approved the Columbia Financial, Inc. 2019 Equity Incentive Plan (&#8220;2019 Plan&#8221;) which provides for the issuance of up to <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" contextRef="PAsOn06_06_2019" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169235">7,949,996</ix:nonFraction> shares (<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" contextRef="PAsOn06_06_2019_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169236">2,271,427</ix:nonFraction> restricted stock awards and<div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"> </div><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" contextRef="PAsOn06_06_2019_EmployeeStockOptionMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169237">5,678,569</ix:nonFraction> stock options) of common stock. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On March&#160;6, 2024, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P03_06_2024To03_06_2024_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169238">185,279</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted stock were awarded, with a grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="P03_06_2024To03_06_2024_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD_per_Share" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169239">16.49</ix:nonFraction> per share. To fund the grant of restricted common stock, the Company issued shares from authorized but unissued shares. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On March&#160;7, 2024, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P03_07_2024To03_07_2024_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169240">27,162</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted stock were awarded, with a grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="P03_07_2024To03_07_2024_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD_per_Share" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169241">16.57</ix:nonFraction> per share. To fund the grant of restricted common stock, the Company issued shares from authorized but unissued shares. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On December&#160;13, 2024, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P12_13_2024To12_13_2024_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169242">38,389</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted stock were awarded, with a grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="P12_13_2024To12_13_2024_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD_per_Share" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169243">16.93</ix:nonFraction> per share. To fund the grant of restricted common stock, the Company issued shares from authorized but unissued shares. </div><div style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center"><ix:exclude>F-54</ix:exclude> </div></ix:continuation></div></div><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_45" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_46"><ix:exclude><div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_46" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_47"><ix:exclude><hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_47" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_48"><ix:exclude><div style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold; margin-top: 1.67em; margin-bottom: 1.67em;"><a href="#toc">Table of Contents</a></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_48" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_49"><ix:exclude><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">COLUMBIA FINANCIAL, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES </div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements </div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_49" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_50"><div style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_50" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_51"><ix:exclude>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%">
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid">
<td style="width:4%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;">(14)</div></td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:left">Employee Benefit Plans&#8201;(continued) </div></td></tr></table></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_51" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156162868_52"><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;"><ix:exclude>Stock Based Compensation&#8201;(continued)</ix:exclude> </div></div><div style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On March&#160;3, 2025, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P03_03_2025To03_03_2025_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169246">177,186</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted stock were awarded, with a grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="P03_03_2025To03_03_2025_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD_per_Share" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169247">16.23</ix:nonFraction> per share. To fund the grant of restricted common stock, the Company issued shares from authorized but unissued shares. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On March&#160;11, 2025, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P03_11_2025To03_11_2025_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169248">32,070</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted stock were awarded, with a grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="P03_11_2025To03_11_2025_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD_per_Share" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169249">15.01</ix:nonFraction> per share. To fund the grant of restricted common stock, the Company issued shares from authorized but unissued shares. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">At December&#160;31, 2025, there were <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169250">207,594</ix:nonFraction> shares remaining available for future restricted stock awards, and <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_EmployeeStockOptionMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169251">1,171,755</ix:nonFraction> shares remaining available for future stock option grants under the plan. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Restricted shares granted under the 2019 Plan generally vest in equal installments, over the performance or service periods ranging from one year to five years, beginning one year from the date of grant. A portion of restricted shares awarded are performance awards, which vest upon the satisfactory attainment of certain corporate financial targets. Management recognizes compensation expense for the fair value of restricted shares on a straight-line basis over the requisite performance or service period. During the years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024, and 2023, approximately $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169252">2.7</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169253">3.5</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169254">4.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively, in expense was recognized in regard to these awards. The expected future compensation expense related to the <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedNumber" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169255">438,894</ix:nonFraction> <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">non-vested</div> restricted shares outstanding at December&#160;31, 2025 is approximately $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-169256">3.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million over a weighted average period of <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_RestrictedStockMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="ixv-169257">1.2</ix:nonNumeric> years. </div><ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:NonvestedRestrictedStockSharesActivityTableTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-99806"><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The following is a summary of the Company&#8217;s restricted stock activity during the years ended December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024: </div><div style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
