<td style="vertical-align:top"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Balance of recurring Level&#160;3 assets - December&#160;31, 2025</div></td>
