="ixv-170882">6.7</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:HeldToMaturitySecuritiesRestricted" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-170883">9.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively, were pledged to secure repurchase agreements and deposits. See Note&#160;9 &#8211; &#8220;Borrowings&#8221; for further discussion regarding securities pledged or encumbered for borrowings. </div><div style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center"><ix:exclude>F-97</ix:exclude> </div></ix:continuation></ix:continuation></ix:continuation></div></div><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156155995_5" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156155995_6"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156155994_5" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156155994_6"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156156378_11" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156156378_12"><ix:exclude><div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156156378_12" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156156378_13"><ix:exclude><hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156156378_13" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156156378_14"><ix:exclude><div style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold; margin-top: 1.67em; margin-bottom: 1.67em;"><a href="#toc">Table of Contents</a></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation></ix:continuation></ix:continuation><div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156155995_6" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156155995_7"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppe