<td>&#160;</td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Depreciation expense for the years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024, and 2023, was $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172338">3.2</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172339">3.6</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172340">3.7</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively. There were <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:GainLossOnSaleOfPropertyPlantEquipment" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="ixv-172341">no</ix:nonFraction> sales of premises and equipment during the year ended December&#160;31, 2025. The Company sold premises and equipment during 2024, with a book balance of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentSalvageValue" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172342">389,000</ix:nonFraction> and realized a gain of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:GainLossOnSaleOfPropertyPlantEquipment" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172343">3.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. There were <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:GainLossOnSaleOfPropertyPlantEquipment" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="ixv-172344">no</ix:nonFraction> sales of premises and equipment in 2023. </div><div style="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div></ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:DepositLiabilitiesDisclosuresTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" escape="true" continuedAt="TextSelection_156162869" id="ixv-132578">
