<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Includes a $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtLongtermAndShorttermCombinedAmount" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172410">130.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million overnight line of credit at December&#160;31, 2025.<div style="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top;display:inline;font-size:8.3px">&#160;</div> </div></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">All FHLB advances as of December&#160;31, 2025, have fixed rates at rates ranging from <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FederalHomeLoanBankAdvancesInterestRate" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_MinimumMembersrtRangeAxis_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172411">0.95</ix:nonFraction>% to <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FederalHomeLoanBankAdvancesInterestRate" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_MaximumMembersrtRangeAxis_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172412">4.66</ix:nonFraction>%, averaging <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FederalHomeLoanBankAdvancesWeightedAverageInterestRate" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172413">3.85</ix:nonFraction>%, and are payable at stated maturities from January&#160;2, 2026, through September&#160;5, 2028, with a prepayment penalty. All FHLB advances as of December&#160;31, 2024, have fixed rates at rates ranging from <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FederalHomeLoanBankAdvancesInterestRate" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_MinimumMembersrtRangeAxis_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172414">0.87</ix:nonFraction>% to <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FederalHomeLoanBankAdvancesInterestRate" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_MaximumMembersrtRangeAxis_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172415">4.66</ix:nonFraction>%, averaging <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FederalHomeLoanBankAdvancesWeightedAverageInterestRate" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172416">3.47</ix:nonFraction>%, and were payable at stated maturities from January&#160;10, 2025, through July&#160;3, 2028, with a prepayment penalty. </div><ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfMaturitiesOfLongTermDebtTableTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" escape="true" continuedAt="TextSelection_156156068" id="ixv-133389"><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">At December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, FHLB advances had contractual maturities as follows (in thousands): </div><div style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
