<td style="vertical-align:bottom"/></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">There was no remaining future stock option expense related to the options outstanding as of December&#160;31, 2025, as all are vested. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">During 2025, the Company granted to directors and employees, under the 2019 Equity Incentive Plan, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172755">238,186</ix:nonFraction> restricted stock awards with a total grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementbySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherthanOptionsGrantsinPeriodGrantDateValue" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172756">2.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. Of these grants, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheOneMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172757">41,679</ix:nonFraction> vest one year from the date of grant, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172758">6,183</ix:nonFraction> vest in equal installments over a <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">two-year</div> period beginning one year from the date of grant, and <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheThreeMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172759">190,324</ix:nonFraction> vest in equal installments over a three-year period beginning one year from the date of grant. The Company also issued <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_PerformanceSharesMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172760">59,735</ix:nonFraction> performance-based restricted stock units to its executive officers with a total grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementbySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherthanOptionsGrantsinPeriodGrantDateValue" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_PerformanceSharesMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172761">697,000</ix:nonFraction>. Vesting of the performance-based restricted stock units will be based on achievement of certain levels of Core Return on Average Assets and will cliff vest after a <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" contextRef="P01_24_2025To01_24_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_PerformanceSharesMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="ixv-172762">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> measurement period ending on January&#160;24, 2028. At the end of the performance period, the number of actual shares to be awarded may vary between <ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfSharesIssuableBasedOnTargetAmounts" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_MinimumMembersrtRangeAxis_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_PerformanceSharesMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172763">0</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfSharesIssuableBasedOnTargetAmounts" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_MaximumMembersrtRangeAxis_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_PerformanceSharesMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172764">225</ix:nonFraction>% of target amounts. </div><div style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center"><ix:exclude>F-120</ix:exclude> </div></ix:nonNumeric></div></div><ix:continuation id="TextSelection_156159327" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156159327_1"><ix:exclude><div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156159327_1" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156159327_2"><ix:exclude><hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156159327_2" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156159327_3"><ix:exclude><div style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold; margin-top: 1.67em; margin-bottom: 1.67em;"><a href="#toc">Table of Contents</a></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation></div></div> <div><div style="line-height:normal;display: inline;"><div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156159327_3" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_156159327_4"><ix:exclude><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">NORTHFIELD BANCORP, INC.&#160;AND SUBSIDIARIES </div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements&#8201;(Continued) </div><div style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_156159327_4"><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">During 2024, the Company granted to directors and employees, under the 2019 Equity Incentive Plan <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172766">196,554</ix:nonFraction> restricted stock awards with a total grant-date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementbySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherthanOptionsGrantsinPeriodGrantDateValue" contextRef="P01_01_2024To01_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172767">2.6</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. Of these grants, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheOneMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172768">40,708</ix:nonFraction> vest <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockAndRestrictedStockUnitsRSUsMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheOneMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="ixv-172769">one year</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant and <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172770">155,846</ix:nonFraction> vest in equal installments over a <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockAndRestrictedStockUnitsRSUsMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="ixv-172771">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period beginning <ix:nonNumeric name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementbySharebasedPaymentAwardPeriodAfterGrantDateToBeginVesting" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockAndRestrictedStockUnitsRSUsMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="ixv-172772">one year</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant. The Company also issued <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_PerformanceSharesMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172773">43,672</ix:nonFraction> performance-based restricted stock units to its executive officers with a total grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementbySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherthanOptionsGrantsinPeriodGrantDateValue" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_PerformanceSharesMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172774">581,000</ix:nonFraction>. Vesting of the performance-based restricted stock units will be based on achievement of certain levels of Core Return on Average Assets and will cliff-vest after a three-year measurement period ending January&#160;26, 2027. At the end of the performance period, the number of actual shares to be awarded may vary between <ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfSharesIssuableBasedOnTargetAmounts" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_MinimumMembersrtRangeAxis_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172775">0</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfSharesIssuableBasedOnTargetAmounts" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_MaximumMembersrtRangeAxis_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172776">225</ix:nonFraction>% of target amounts. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">During 2023, the Company granted to directors and employees, under the 2019 Equity Incentive Plan, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172777">157,525</ix:nonFraction> restricted stock awards with a total grant-date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementbySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherthanOptionsGrantsinPeriodGrantDateValue" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172778">2.3</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. A further <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P08_01_2023To08_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172779">2,357</ix:nonFraction> restricted stock awards with a total grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementbySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherthanOptionsGrantsinPeriodGrantDateValue" contextRef="P08_01_2023To08_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172780">25,000</ix:nonFraction> were granted to an employee in August 2023. Of these grants, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheOneMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172781">36,170</ix:nonFraction> vest <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockAndRestrictedStockUnitsRSUsMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheOneMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="ixv-172782">one year</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant and <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172783">123,712</ix:nonFraction> vest in equal installments over a <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockAndRestrictedStockUnitsRSUsMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="ixv-172784">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period beginning <ix:nonNumeric name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementbySharebasedPaymentAwardPeriodAfterGrantDateToBeginVesting" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_RestrictedStockAndRestrictedStockUnitsRSUsMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMemberusgaapVestingAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="ixv-172785">one year</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant. The Company also issued <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_PerformanceSharesMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172786">34,724</ix:nonFraction> performance-based restricted stock units to its executive officers with a total grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementbySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherthanOptionsGrantsinPeriodGrantDateValue" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_PerformanceSharesMemberusgaapAwardTypeAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172787">499,000</ix:nonFraction>. Vesting of the performance-based restricted stock units will be based on achievement of certain levels of Core Return on Average Assets and will cliff-vest after a three-year measurement period ended January&#160;27, 2026. At the end of the performance period, the number of actual shares to be awarded may vary between <ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfSharesIssuableBasedOnTargetAmounts" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_MinimumMembersrtRangeAxis_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172788">0</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction name="clbk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfSharesIssuableBasedOnTargetAmounts" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_MaximumMembersrtRangeAxis_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis_TwoThousandNineteenEquityIncentivePlanMemberusgaapPlanNameAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-172789">120</ix:nonFraction>% of target amounts. </div><ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfNonvestedShareActivityTableTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" escape="true" id="ixv-136277"><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The following is a summary of the status of the Company&#8217;s restricted shares as of December&#160;31, 2025, and changes therein during the year then ended (dollars in thousands): </div><div style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
