t-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Upon the exercise of stock options, management expects to utilize treasury stock as the source of issuance for these shares. </div></ix:continuation><div style="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div><ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:CommitmentsAndContingenciesDisclosureTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" escape="true" continuedAt="TextSelection_156162867" id="ixv-136581">
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%">
