<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:left">Commitments and Contingencies </div></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Company, in the normal course of business, is party to commitments that involve, to varying degrees, elements of risk in excess of the amounts recognized in the consolidated financial statements. These commitments include unused lines of credit and commitments to extend credit. </div><ix:nonNumeric name="clbk:ScheduleOfCommitmentsAndContingenciesTableTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_NorthfieldBancorpIncMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" escape="true" id="ixv-136589"><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">At December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, the following commitment and contingent liabilities existed that are not reflected in the accompanying consolidated financial statements (in thousands): </div><div style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
