<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left">
Agreement shall limit or affect any actions or omissions taken by such Stockholder in such Stockholder&#8217;s capacity as a director or officer and not as a stockholder. </td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
