 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have caused this Bank Merger Agreement to be executed by their respective officers thereunto duly authorized as of the date first above written. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
