 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">In connection with our review of the proposed Transaction and the preparation of this Opinion, we have, among other things: </p> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
