<td style="vertical-align:bottom">Incorporated herein by reference to Exhibit 10.12 to Columbia Financial, Inc.&#8217;s Registration Statement on Form <span style="white-space:nowrap">S-1</span><br/>(File <span style="white-space:nowrap">No.&#160;333-221912),</span> initially filed on December&#160;5, 2017</td></tr>
